# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
# eol=lf forces LF checkouts on every platform (including the Windows
# self-hosted runner): Biome's formatter requires LF, and without this
# `text=auto` alone checks CRLF out on Windows, failing `bun x biome check`
# on all 137 files (run 44372611071).
* text=auto eol=lf
